'''The Pilots' Rest'''<ref name="NYCC 2025">{{SW|url=news/nycc-2025-lucasfilm-publishing-reveals|text=NYCC 2025: All the News and Reveals from the Lucasfilm Publishing Panel}}</ref> was housed in one of the Quonset huts in [[Adelphi Base]].<ref name="Chapter 21" /> Inside the lounge, there were many trophies from the [[Galactic Civil War]], including multiple [[Stormtrooper armor|stormtrooper helmets]], [[Scout trooper armor|scout trooper helmets]], [[Imperial Starfighter Pilot|TIE pilot]] helmets, and parts of many droids, including a [[probe droid]], a [[RA-7 protocol droid]] head, an [[astromech droid]] head an [[IG-series assassin droid]] head.<ref name="Chapter 21" /><ref name="Chapter 24">{{TheMandalorian|Chapter 24: The Return}}</ref> Around [[9 ABY]],<ref name="Date">{{MandoDate|17}}</ref> [[Captain]] [[Carson Teva]] received a message from [[High Magistrate]] [[Greef Karga]] in the lounge.<ref name="Chapter 21" />

